message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: 'websemantic: a software-agnostic semantic layer from human intent to qualified
  simulated data'
type: software
authors:
- name: WebSemantic contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/websemantic
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
version: 0.0.1
date-released: '2026-10-03'
abstract: 'Semantic framework for preparing scientific simulation scenarios, validating
  typed configurations and qualifying numerical outputs with explicit provenance.
  The current implementation runs a pinned TLS backend and exports CSV, JSON and RDF.
  Outputs are synthetic and have not been validated against field measurements.

  '
